#: 6766aedcc07e4a759959bbd90a8550e7
msgid ""
"Loaded in `on_init` / construction / first waist-planner create / "
"hardware plugin `on_init`. Change the YAML or xacro and reload or "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"在 `on_init` / 构造 / 首次创建腰部规划器 / 硬件插件 `on_init` 时加载。改 YAML 或 xacro "
"后需要重新加载或重启。"

